    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wind's Path is a top down platformer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/cf5836f7dd9f7340d6e4816b17f124b9.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been granted the power to control the wind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/6a436066678fe6d58e264c01e75df74f.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wind powers are fueled by the &quot;Flow&quot; meter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/1548d62f9854d5b58f42fe7e0a14e9da.poster.avif?t=1743591584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/1548d62f9854d5b58f42fe7e0a14e9da.webm?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/0a010a50578420adc219eb33d7ecf0ba.poster.avif?t=1743591584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/0a010a50578420adc219eb33d7ecf0ba.webm?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/0a010a50578420adc219eb33d7ecf0ba.mp4?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various wind powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/fbc59df5c8d89a3fe006b041db4155de.poster.avif?t=1743591584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/fbc59df5c8d89a3fe006b041db4155de.webm?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/fbc59df5c8d89a3fe006b041db4155de.mp4?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks and defeat dangerous enemies to increase Flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/b449e4ef15aec0c0dce03fa076c91731.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from world to world to recover reality altering shards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/3d4cb7765ba85ed3768c5817421e612e.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Wind's Path is a top down platformer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/cf5836f7dd9f7340d6e4816b17f124b9.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've been granted the power to control the wind!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/6a436066678fe6d58e264c01e75df74f.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your wind powers are fueled by the &quot;Flow&quot; meter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/1548d62f9854d5b58f42fe7e0a14e9da.poster.avif?t=1743591584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/1548d62f9854d5b58f42fe7e0a14e9da.webm?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/0a010a50578420adc219eb33d7ecf0ba.poster.avif?t=1743591584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/0a010a50578420adc219eb33d7ecf0ba.webm?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/0a010a50578420adc219eb33d7ecf0ba.mp4?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock various wind powers!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/fbc59df5c8d89a3fe006b041db4155de.poster.avif?t=1743591584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/fbc59df5c8d89a3fe006b041db4155de.webm?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/fbc59df5c8d89a3fe006b041db4155de.mp4?t=1743591584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge attacks and defeat dangerous enemies to increase Flow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/b449e4ef15aec0c0dce03fa076c91731.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel from world to world to recover reality altering shards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2424500/extras/3d4cb7765ba85ed3768c5817421e612e.avif?t=1743591584\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "The Wind's Path is a fast-paced top down singleplayer game. If you want to stay alive, keep moving. A mysterious force is wreaking havoc in other worlds and only you can stop it. You'll unlock powerful wind abilities that not only make you a force of nature but help you fly through difficult levels.",
